1
00:00:05,347 --> 00:00:07,227
- Hello, Stuart.
- Hey, Sheldon.

2
00:00:07,391 --> 00:00:09,021
(Stuart:)- Help you with anything?
- Yes.

3
00:00:09,185 --> 00:00:12,855
(Sheldon:)I'm attending a party this weekend
for a 93-year-old woman.

4
00:00:14,398 --> 00:00:16,568
(Sheldon:)Can you recommend a gift?

5
00:00:17,193 --> 00:00:19,023
(Stuart:)Uh, I don't know.

6
00:00:19,195 --> 00:00:22,365
(Stuart:)Could put a tennis ball on the end
of Excalibur...

7
00:00:22,531 --> 00:00:25,321
(Stuart:)...make a pretty bad-ass cane.

8
00:00:25,993 --> 00:00:27,243
Do you supply the ball?

9
00:00:27,411 --> 00:00:29,041
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Then no.

10
00:00:30,789 --> 00:00:33,669
(Sheldon:)- What else?
- Uh, oh.

11
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:37,504
Got this collector's edition
Batman Utility BeIt.

12
00:00:37,671 --> 00:00:41,301
Maybe she could use it
as a wearable pill caddy.

13
00:00:42,384 --> 00:00:46,434
(Sheldon:)Well, she'd just look silly wearing that
without the rest of the costume.

14
00:00:49,058 --> 00:00:51,228
Um, sorry, Sheldon, that's it.
That's all I got.

15
00:00:51,393 --> 00:00:54,103
It's not your fauIt.
l've been to the model-train store.

16
00:00:54,313 --> 00:00:58,313
l've been to Radio Shack.
This woman's impossible to shop for.

17
00:00:59,068 --> 00:01:01,528
l'd make fun of Sheldon
for having girl problems...

